    "confirm.leave_app.call": {
      "comment": "Leave-the-app confirmation before a phone call (router callDesk); %@ is the desk name. | es: Miami Spanish (US Spanish, usted where addressed), agent-authored; no human review record yet. | ht: Haitian Creole drafted by the myAD Language agent from general knowledge of standard Kreyòl orthography (Akademi Kreyòl Ayisyen spelling). Not reviewed by a native speaker; must stay needs_review until a human native-speaker pass (decision D9).",
